   <media:description>Range Rover GT, the newest addition to the Range Rover family, has completed its latest dynamic test.
 
Travelling from the UK to Nürburgring, Germany and back, the electric GT completed dynamic tests in real-life conditions.
 
The most aerodynamic Range Rover ever, GT represents a visionary new expression of the brand, defined by a sleek silhouette and coupé proportions.
 
Combining effortless cruising with elegant agility, the vehicle has the lowest centre of gravity of any Range Rover to date, offering continent-crossing comfort with peerless poise and trademark all-terrain capability.
 
Alongside precise, responsive handling engineered for an engaging and refined on-road drive, reduced wind noise creates a calm and quiet interior experience.
 
Joining Range Rover, Range Rover Sport, Range Rover Velar, and Range Rover Evoque, the Grand Tourer delivers customary Range Rover comfort and first-class long-haul refinement.
 
——
 
Vehicle shown is a prototype and not available for sale. Final production model may differ.</media:description>
