  <media:group>
   <media:title>Range Rover Sport Electric | Leading the Charge</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/eDUQ_d9Y8jc?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i2.ytimg.com/vi/eDUQ_d9Y8jc/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Range Rover Sport Electric is the most dynamic Range Rover Sport ever. Sporting luxury enters the electric age with greater power and torque than any Range Rover Sport before, combining visceral performance, peerless refinement, and unmistakable presence.​

Electrification amplifies the dynamic character of Range Rover Sport. Powered by dual electric motors producing up to 550PS and 850Nm of instant torque, Range Rover Sport Electric delivers rapid, precise responses that heighten confidence behind the wheel. Intelligent Torque Management continuously optimises torque distribution, reacting in milliseconds to maximise traction, agility, and control across changing conditions. The result is a luxury electric SUV with exceptional performance on-road and composure across challenging terrain.​

Enhanced torsional stiffness provides the strong foundation required for advanced chassis technologies to perform at their best. Dynamic Air Suspension, Adaptive Dynamics, and Integrated Chassis Control work together to deliver outstanding body control, confident handling and a more planted, connected driving experience. Every input is met with precise, predictable responses that inspire confidence.​

Capability has been engineered into every aspect of Range Rover Sport Electric. Advanced all-wheel-drive technology, intelligent traction management, and instant electric torque work together to optimise performance across a wide variety of surfaces. Single Pedal Driving is tuned for engagement both on and off-road, working seamlessly with regenerative braking to provide smooth progress, precise control, and enhanced efficiency. With a wading depth of up to 900mm and extensive testing across challenging environments, Range Rover Sport Electric combines dynamic performance with exceptional all-terrain capability.​

Long-distance electric travel is effortless with Range Rover Sport Electric. A WLTP range of up to 609km (378 miles) and a real-world range of up to 535km (333 miles) provide the confidence to go further. EV route planner in intelligent navigation continuously monitors energy usage, identifies suitable charging locations, and prepares the battery ahead of charging stops, helping optimise charging performance throughout the journey. Charging can be scheduled and controlled through the Range Rover OneApp, with optional dual-sided charge ports add convenience whether charging at home or on the move.​

Built on advanced 800V architecture, Range Rover Sport Electric supports ultra-fast charging designed for longer journeys. It can charge from 10-80 per cent in as little as 22 minutes using a 350kW DC rapid charger and add up to 220km (136 miles) of range in approximately 10 minutes. The advanced split-pack battery design is compatible with both 800V and 400V charging infrastructure, enabling access to the widest possible range of public charging networks and helping maximise time on the road.​

An intelligent heat management system, ThermAssist, continuously optimises battery performance and charging capability across a range of conditions, hot or cold. By intelligently managing heat transfer around the vehicle, it helps support efficiency, range, and charging performance while maintaining consistent capability when temperatures change. Working alongside battery pre-conditioning and intelligent navigation, it helps ensure the vehicle is always ready to perform.​

From precision handling and instant torque to exceptional capability, intelligent charging and long-distance confidence, Range Rover Sport Electric redefines sporting luxury for the electric era. Dynamic, capable, and engaging, it is electrification dialled up.​

#RangeRoverSportElectric​

