   <media:title>Range Rover Sport Electric | Peak to Peak Challenge</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/JzHlw4lxEN0?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i3.ytimg.com/vi/JzHlw4lxEN0/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Range Rover Sport Electric. Peak to Peak.

Every defining moment deserves a defining challenge. Set amongst the 3,000ft open-air marble peaks of Carrara, Italy, the Peak to Peak Challenge pushes capability to its limits. Steep 45 degree ascents, sheer drops, extreme temperatures and unpredictable surfaces. A demanding climb leading to the peak, high above the marble quarry floor.

Range Rover Sport Electric redefines what electric performance can feel like. Delivering 550PS and 850Nm of instant torque, it offers more power and torque than any Range Rover Sport before it, responding with exceptional precision the moment you press the accelerator.

Integrated electric propulsion system transforms every input into immediate action. Intelligent Torque Management adjusts torque in milliseconds, delivering responses up to 100 times faster than an ICE Range Rover Sport, while Dynamic Mode sharpens reactions for an even more engaging drive.

With 0-60mph in just 4.3 seconds in Dynamic Launch Mode, Range Rover Sport Electric combines effortless acceleration with the confidence and control expected from a Range Rover. Dual electric motors deliver 550PS and 850Nm of instant torque, creating an immediate and rewarding connection between driver and vehicle across changing terrain.

Switching to electric does not mean compromising on driver engagement. Enhanced Torsional Stiffness provides the foundation for Range Rover Sport Electric's advanced chassis technologies to deliver a responsive and connected driving experience while maintaining the confidence and control expected from any Range Rover Sport combustion-powered predecessors. Agile, composed and responsive, Range Rover Sport Electric delivers the dynamic character of a luxury SUV while maintaining the refinement synonymous with the Range Rover name.

Single Pedal Driving is tuned to be as engaging as possible, on and off-road. It enables smooth, precise progress and increased involvement, stopping and holding without touching the brakes, delivering effortless control while helping to optimise energy efficiency. Intelligent Traction Management and Dynamic Air Suspension work in harmony to maintain traction and control across any terrain where precision matters most.

Designed with a confident, muscular stance and enhanced by EV-specific details, Range Rover Sport Electric reflects the performance within. Every element serves a purpose, communicating power, agility and modern sporting luxury.

Powered by a 118.5kWh lithium-ion battery offering up to 609 km (or 378 miles) of range, and supported by an 800-volt architecture with split-charging technology, Range Rover Sport Electric hosts a seamlessly-integrated electric propulsion system for effortless performance with uncompromising capability. ThermAssist, an intelligent heat management system, helps optimise battery performance and charging capability across a range of driving conditions including cold weather, supporting efficiency, confidence, and consistent performance throughout every journey.

Long highway journeys are made effortless with Range Rover Sport Electric's advanced 800-volt architecture and split-charging technology. Engineered to make the most of the fastest public charging networks, it can charge from 10-80 per cent in as little as 22 minutes using a 350kW rapid DC charger or add up to 220km (136 miles) of range in approximately 10 minutes. Intelligent navigation and charging technologies help you spend more time driving and less time charging, making every journey easier to enjoy.

Peak to Peak continues a legacy of extraordinary Range Rover Sport challenges. From a record-setting ascent of Pikes Peak, to the climb to Heaven's Gate in China known as the Dragon Challenge, and the scaling of an Icelandic spillway, Range Rover Sport has consistently redefined what's possible.

Now, electric excellence reaches new heights.

Refer to the comments for the finer details.

