   <media:thumbnail url="https://i3.ytimg.com/vi/FCPVe_vnp2g/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Complete control, with one pedal.

Bring the Range Rover Electric to a complete halt anywhere, without touching the brake pedal.

Working in harmony with Terrain Response system, Single Pedal Driving delivers peerless off-road control using only the accelerator pedal and provides smoother acceleration and advanced traction across all surfaces.

It also features automatic secure hill hold for true single-pedal driving on slopes, both on- and off-road, enabling the vehicle to effortlessly climb 45-degree slopes.

An intuitive drive, whatever the conditions, regenerative braking seamlessly slows the vehicle to a standstill while optimising energy efficiency.

#RangeRoverElectric

Model shown is a 27MY Range Rover Electric First Edition Global Spec with optional features. Availability and specifications vary by market, check with your local retailer.</media:description>
