   <media:thumbnail url="https://i2.ytimg.com/vi/MSk2cQx5q8A/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Keep uninvited guests out.
.
Range Rover Electric ensures outside impurities are kept outside with the most comprehensive suite of cabin air technologies in its class.

The pioneering Cabin Air Purification Pro, with PM2.5 filtration and nanoe™ X device, significantly reduces odours, bacteria, pathogens and allergens.

The system can be operated remotely, so the vehicle can be primed before embarking on a journey. CO₂ Management enhances air purification in the cabin by monitoring levels inside to heighten wellness and alertness.

The Ambient Fragrance Diffuser gently scents the cabin with luxurious perfumes to set the mood. Available for the first time in a Range Rover, the diffuser offers three specially created scents.

#RangeRoverElectric

Model shown is a 27MY Range Rover Electric Autobiography Global Spec with optional features. Availability and specifications vary by market, check with your local retailer. The PM2.5 filtration and Nanoe X technology may significantly reduce odours, bacteria, pathogens and allergens, when used as directed.</media:description>
